    { "do": "describe", "stage": "2-expanded", "note": "Option E with the cut picked opens it into two rows under V1, A for the recording and B for the b-roll: A runs half a second past the cut, hatched, B comes up half a second early, hatched, and both on screen 1.0s sits over the second where both are on screen. The clips on V1 did not move" },

